<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('../partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('../partials/header') %>

  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumbs">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span>About Us</span>
      </div>
      <div class="page-hero-content">
        <span class="eyebrow" style="color:#38bdf8;">Engineering Heritage</span>
        <h1>About REINWERK Reinraum- und Anlagentechnik</h1>
        <p>
          We are a specialized German cleanroom and plant engineering contractor delivering certified contamination control environments, modular architectural envelopes, and precision HVAC air handling for high-tech industries globally.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Company Overview & Heritage -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="service-overview-grid">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Our Philosophy</span>
          <h2 class="section-title">German Precision in Contamination Control</h2>
          <p style="font-size:1.0625rem; color:var(--slate-700); margin-bottom:20px; line-height:1.7;">
            Headquartered in Stuttgart, Germany, <strong>REINWERK Reinraum- und Anlagentechnik</strong> was founded on a simple principle: cleanroom construction requires the same precision as the high-tech processes housed within it. In pharmaceutical fill-finish suites or semiconductor photolithography bays, a single airborne particle can compromise millions of euros in product value.
          </p>
          <p style="font-size:1rem; color:var(--slate-600); margin-bottom:24px; line-height:1.7;">
            We operate as a true single-source turnkey partner. Unlike conventional general contractors who subcontract critical ventilation and partition packages to disparate vendors, REINWERK integrates in-house architectural design, thermodynamic HVAC engineering, off-site modular prefabrication, and certified on-site DQ/IQ/OQ/PQ validation.
          </p>

          <div class="grid-2" style="margin-top:32px;">
            <div style="background:var(--slate-50); padding:20px; border-radius:var(--radius-md); border-left:3px solid var(--primary-navy);">
              <h4 style="font-size:1.0625rem; margin-bottom:8px; color:var(--primary-navy);">Off-site Modular Efficiency</h4>
              <p style="font-size:0.875rem; color:var(--slate-600);">Up to 90% prefabrication ensures dust-free installation, strict factory tolerance checks, and reduced on-site schedules.</p>
            </div>
            <div style="background:var(--slate-50); padding:20px; border-radius:var(--radius-md); border-left:3px solid var(--accent-red);">
              <h4 style="font-size:1.0625rem; margin-bottom:8px; color:var(--accent-red);">Audit-Ready Compliance</h4>
              <p style="font-size:0.875rem; color:var(--slate-600);">Comprehensive validation dossiers satisfying FDA, EMA, and ISO auditors without ambiguity or delay.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="spec-box">
            <h3 class="spec-box-title">REINWERK Corporate Profile</h3>
            <table class="spec-table">
              <tr>
                <td class="label">Legal Entity</td>
                <td class="value">REINWERK Reinraum- und Anlagentechnik GmbH</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="label">Engineering HQ</td>
                <td class="value">Stuttgart, Baden-Württemberg, Germany</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="label">Core Specialization</td>
                <td class="value">Turnkey Cleanrooms & Plant Engineering</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="label">Primary Standards</td>
                <td class="value">DIN EN ISO 14644-1:2015, EU-GMP Annex 1, VDI 2083</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="label">Validation Protocols</td>
                <td class="value">GAMP 5 (DQ, IQ, OQ, PQ)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="label">Service Reach</td>
                <td class="value">Germany, Switzerland, Austria & International</td>
              </tr>
            </table>

            <div style="margin-top:24px; text-align:center;">
              <a href="/quote" class="btn btn-primary" style="width:100%;">
                Request Cleanroom Consultation
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Core Values -->
  <section class="section section-bg-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="eyebrow">Our Guiding Principles</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Engineering Values that Define Us</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">
          Every cleanroom we engineer reflects our commitment to unyielding regulatory standards, operational longevity, and customer transparency.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-4">
        <div class="card" style="padding:32px;">
          <div style="width:52px; height:52px; background:var(--clean-blue-light); color:var(--primary-navy); border-radius:var(--radius-md); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:20px;">
            <i data-feather="target" style="width:26px; height:26px;"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.25rem; margin-bottom:12px;">Precision Engineering</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.9375rem; color:var(--slate-600);">
            Zero compromises on surface coplanarity, differential pressure stability, or aerodynamic laminar uniformity.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="padding:32px;">
          <div style="width:52px; height:52px; background:var(--clean-blue-light); color:var(--primary-navy); border-radius:var(--radius-md); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:20px;">
            <i data-feather="file-text" style="width:26px; height:26px;"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.25rem; margin-bottom:12px;">Regulatory Rigor</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.9375rem; color:var(--slate-600);">
            Every cleanroom design and installation is backed by comprehensive traceability, calibration certificates, and audit-ready test reports.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="padding:32px;">
          <div style="width:52px; height:52px; background:var(--clean-blue-light); color:var(--primary-navy); border-radius:var(--radius-md); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:20px;">
            <i data-feather="zap" style="width:26px; height:26px;"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.25rem; margin-bottom:12px;">Energy Efficiency</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.9375rem; color:var(--slate-600);">
            Incorporating EC fan technology, heat recovery wheels, and automated occupancy setback controls to slash cleanroom energy overheads.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="padding:32px;">
          <div style="width:52px; height:52px; background:var(--clean-blue-light); color:var(--primary-navy); border-radius:var(--radius-md); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:20px;">
            <i data-feather="users" style="width:26px; height:26px;"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.25rem; margin-bottom:12px;">Partnership Culture</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.9375rem; color:var(--slate-600);">
            We work alongside your process engineers, quality directors, and plant managers from the first conceptual sketch through lifecycle servicing.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Reusable CTA Consultation Banner -->
  <%- include('../partials/cta-banner') %>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
